Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.46,0:00:03.38,Default,,0,0,0,,SponsorScout. A final project film by Akshit
Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.38,0:00:05.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Verma, in four parts.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.21,0:00:07.62,Default,,0,0,0,,International students looking for data jobs
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.62,0:00:09.17,Default,,0,0,0,,have a short clock,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.17,0:00:12.16,Default,,0,0,0,,and only some employers sponsor visas.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.42,0:00:14.28,Default,,0,0,0,,So we apply to sponsors.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.42,0:00:16.67,Default,,0,0,0,,But many of them have no entry-level
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.67,0:00:18.25,Default,,0,0,0,,data job open today,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.25,0:00:20.83,Default,,0,0,0,,and those applications go nowhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.67,0:00:22.67,Default,,0,0,0,,SponsorScout tells the student,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.67,0:00:23.75,Default,,0,0,0,,for each sponsor,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.75,0:00:24.92,Default,,0,0,0,,whether to apply,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.92,0:00:26.87,Default,,0,0,0,,network, check by hand,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.87,0:00:29.62,Default,,0,0,0,,or skip, with the public record behind
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.62,0:00:32.83,Default,,0,0,0,,every answer. A strong sponsor with nothing
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.83,0:00:34.66,Default,,0,0,0,,open isn't dropped.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.71,0:00:36.46,Default,,0,0,0,,It goes on a networking list.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.46,0:00:37.37,Default,,0,0,0,,It never applies,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.37,0:00:40.28,Default,,0,0,0,,emails, or contacts anyone.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.46,0:00:41.95,Default,,0,0,0,,The person decides.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.17,0:00:44.46,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm building it because I'm job hunting
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.46,0:00:47.17,Default,,0,0,0,,too, and I wanted a smarter strategy
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.17,0:00:49.71,Default,,0,0,0,,than a hundred-plus applications a day.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.71,0:00:51.24,Default,,0,0,0,,What already exists?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.42,0:00:53.62,Default,,0,0,0,,My Visa Jobs lists sponsors and their
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.62,0:00:55.29,Default,,0,0,0,,past job counts;
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.29,0:00:57.00,Default,,0,0,0,,I looked at it in October.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.00,0:00:59.71,Default,,0,0,0,,H one B Grader grades employers on
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.71,0:01:02.12,Default,,0,0,0,,past approvals and denials.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.25,0:01:04.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Interstride, which universities provide,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.58,0:01:07.67,Default,,0,0,0,,shows sponsorship history and filters jobs
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.67,0:01:08.67,Default,,0,0,0,,by visa.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.67,0:01:11.17,Default,,0,0,0,,The Reallocation Engine's own scorer,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.17,0:01:13.00,Default,,0,0,0,,which I had Claude Code run in
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.00,0:01:15.71,Default,,0,0,0,,October, gives a sponsor with no open
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.71,0:01:16.71,Default,,0,0,0,,job a zero,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.71,0:01:18.07,Default,,0,0,0,,and skips it.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.12,0:01:20.79,Default,,0,0,0,,These tools show who sponsored before,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.79,0:01:22.62,Default,,0,0,0,,or what's open now.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.83,0:01:24.71,Default,,0,0,0,,None that I found turns a proven
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.71,0:01:27.08,Default,,0,0,0,,sponsor with nothing open into a networking
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.08,0:01:29.17,Default,,0,0,0,,target. That's the gap.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.17,0:01:30.66,Default,,0,0,0,,The data is public.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.71,0:01:32.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Sponsorship records from the Eighty Days
Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.87,0:01:34.28,Default,,0,0,0,,to Stay file.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.42,0:01:37.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Recent funding from S E C Form
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.46,0:01:39.87,Default,,0,0,0,,D filings. Open jobs from the public
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.87,0:01:43.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Greenhouse, Lever, and Ashby job boards.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.58,0:01:45.42,Default,,0,0,0,,The job seeker is fictional.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.42,0:01:47.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Each sponsor gets three checks:
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.71,0:01:49.67,Default,,0,0,0,,has it sponsored data roles,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.67,0:01:51.67,Default,,0,0,0,,has it raised money recently,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.67,0:01:54.08,Default,,0,0,0,,and is an entry-level data job open
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.08,0:01:56.62,Default,,0,0,0,,today? The answers set the verdict.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.62,0:02:00.04,Default,,0,0,0,,The prototype ran on October third,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.04,0:02:02.29,Default,,0,0,0,,on one hundred twenty-three sponsors.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.29,0:02:03.87,Default,,0,0,0,,But only sixteen of them had a
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.87,0:02:05.25,Default,,0,0,0,,known job board,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.25,0:02:07.82,Default,,0,0,0,,so most answers were check by hand.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.00,0:02:09.78,Default,,0,0,0,,So, with Claude Code,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.79,0:02:11.66,Default,,0,0,0,,I built a board resolver.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.83,0:02:14.08,Default,,0,0,0,,It tries names built from each company's
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.08,0:02:16.04,Default,,0,0,0,,name, one request at a time,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.04,0:02:19.00,Default,,0,0,0,,saves every raw response with a fingerprint,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.00,0:02:20.67,Default,,0,0,0,,and stops when it's done,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.67,0:02:21.67,Default,,0,0,0,,out of budget,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.67,0:02:23.12,Default,,0,0,0,,or hitting errors.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.12,0:02:24.70,Default,,0,0,0,,It only proposes.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.87,0:02:27.46,Default,,0,0,0,,I approve or refuse each board,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.46,0:02:29.12,Default,,0,0,0,,and my decision is tied to the
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.12,0:02:31.57,Default,,0,0,0,,fingerprint of the response I saw.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.71,0:02:33.58,Default,,0,0,0,,It can only read from those three
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.58,0:02:35.46,Default,,0,0,0,,sites, and it has no way to
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.46,0:02:36.46,Default,,0,0,0,,send anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.46,0:02:38.04,Default,,0,0,0,,I have what I need:
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.04,0:02:40.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Claude Code, free public job boards,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.62,0:02:42.91,Default,,0,0,0,,no keys, and no paid compute.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.04,0:02:45.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Next, I'll re-run the verdicts on the
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.50,0:02:47.46,Default,,0,0,0,,new boards, then evaluate them.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.46,0:02:49.24,Default,,0,0,0,,How will I know it worked?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.37,0:02:52.25,Default,,0,0,0,,First, coverage. On November twenty-third,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.25,0:02:54.54,Default,,0,0,0,,the resolver made six hundred twenty-nine
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.54,0:02:57.50,Default,,0,0,0,,requests, all to the three allowed sites,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.50,0:03:00.04,Default,,0,0,0,,and found candidate boards for thirty-nine
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.04,0:03:02.99,Default,,0,0,0,,companies. After my review,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.00,0:03:04.92,Default,,0,0,0,,coverage went from sixteen to fifty,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.92,0:03:05.95,Default,,0,0,0,,of one hundred twenty-three.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.87,0:03:08.17,Default,,0,0,0,,It also got things wrong,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.17,0:03:09.78,Default,,0,0,0,,in ways I could check.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.08,0:03:12.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Five boards belonged to other companies,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.08,0:03:14.03,Default,,0,0,0,,like a childcare center.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.29,0:03:15.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Claude flagged them,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.21,0:03:17.49,Default,,0,0,0,,and I refused all five.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.75,0:03:19.92,Default,,0,0,0,,The name check called Weight Watchers a
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.92,0:03:22.66,Default,,0,0,0,,mismatch, though it's the right company.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.87,0:03:24.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Five approved boards are empty,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.83,0:03:27.79,Default,,0,0,0,,and sixty-seven companies showed no board
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.79,0:03:29.29,Default,,0,0,0,,under the names it tried.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.29,0:03:31.78,Default,,0,0,0,,One bug got past every test.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.83,0:03:33.08,Default,,0,0,0,,On a Windows console,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.08,0:03:34.83,Default,,0,0,0,,the command saved my approval,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.83,0:03:37.92,Default,,0,0,0,,then crashed. A test now reproduces it,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.92,0:03:40.37,Default,,0,0,0,,and all twenty-eight tests pass.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.37,0:03:41.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Next, the verdicts.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.87,0:03:43.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Before tuning anything,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.17,0:03:44.96,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll set aside a hand-checked set of
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.96,0:03:47.75,Default,,0,0,0,,sponsors. If fewer than nine in ten
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.75,0:03:50.04,Default,,0,0,0,,apply verdicts are right on that set,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.04,0:03:51.16,Default,,0,0,0,,it didn't work.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.33,0:03:52.92,Default,,0,0,0,,And after fourteen days,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.92,0:03:54.96,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll re-check the networking targets for
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.96,0:03:57.75,Default,,0,0,0,,new postings. This sample can show what
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.75,0:03:58.82,Default,,0,0,0,,it gets wrong.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.96,0:04:01.42,Default,,0,0,0,,It can't show that anyone gets hired.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.75,0:04:04.54,Default,,0,0,0,,SponsorScout. A film by Akshit Verma.
